Package: PACMOSData
Title: ExperimentHub Data for PACMOS
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        "Lipika",
        "Kalson",
        email = "lipikasingh487@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides large reference datasets used by the PACMOS package
    for multi-omics analysis of lung neuroendocrine neoplasms and
    pleural mesothelioma data. The package includes
    resources for MOFA (Multi-Omics Factor Analysis) models and related
    PACMOS examples. Data resources are accessed through ExperimentHub.
